{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 9529528231975555823,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "TC (Traffic Control) and qdisc",
      "source_hash": 13341295759850244391,
      "context_hash": 17965092089278759885,
      "translation": "TC(Traffic Control)와 qdisc",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750779Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "How the kernel shapes, schedules, and polices outbound traffic",
      "source_hash": 3175737531022648115,
      "context_hash": 6043592643557693414,
      "translation": "커널이 송신 트래픽을 셰이핑, 스케줄링, 폴리싱하는 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750779Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What TC does",
      "source_hash": 11162165236517104062,
      "context_hash": 2843205474558582000,
      "translation": "TC의 역할",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750779Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Traffic Control (TC) is the kernel's framework for controlling packet transmission.",
      "source_hash": 5765531630797560866,
      "context_hash": 16882907720264785132,
      "translation": "Traffic Control(TC)은 패킷 전송을 제어하는 커널의 프레임워크입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750779Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It sits between `dev_queue_xmit()` and the NIC driver, and handles:",
      "source_hash": 18286986437033707329,
      "context_hash": 11180920565711917250,
      "translation": "TC는 `dev_queue_xmit()`와 NIC 드라이버 사이에 위치하며, 다음을 처리합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750779Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Shaping**: Rate-limit outbound traffic (TBF, HTB)",
      "source_hash": 14549710686917846920,
      "context_hash": 5833835924210595190,
      "translation": "**셰이핑(Shaping)**: 송신 트래픽의 속도 제한(TBF, HTB)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750779Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Scheduling**: Control which packets go next (PRIO, FQ)",
      "source_hash": 1399952431689172830,
      "context_hash": 14361891546553521826,
      "translation": "**스케줄링(Scheduling)**: 다음에 보낼 패킷 결정(PRIO, FQ)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Policing**: Drop packets exceeding a rate (policer)",
      "source_hash": 7254527839316186328,
      "context_hash": 5637154919654760629,
      "translation": "**폴리싱(Policing)**: 속도를 초과하는 패킷 폐기(policer)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Classification**: Map packets to treatment classes",
      "source_hash": 9101628671750228140,
      "context_hash": 2009852297269324953,
      "translation": "**분류(Classification)**: 패킷을 처리 클래스에 매핑",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "TC only controls **egress** (outbound) by default.",
      "source_hash": 3092893325056501554,
      "context_hash": 443838383113468098,
      "translation": "TC는 기본적으로 **egress**(송신)만 제어합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "Ingress shaping requires redirect tricks (IFB device).",
      "source_hash": 1958052837103397299,
      "context_hash": 12630754936315884728,
      "translation": "인그레스 셰이핑(ingress shaping)에는 리다이렉트 기법(IFB 디바이스)이 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:31:17.203957Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The qdisc hierarchy",
      "source_hash": 12001888875516277280,
      "context_hash": 7414825712544210693,
      "translation": "qdisc 계층 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Every network device has a root **qdisc** (queuing discipline).",
      "source_hash": 11563394970710408405,
      "context_hash": 12955072396220643075,
      "translation": "모든 네트워크 디바이스에는 루트 **qdisc**(queuing discipline)가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:31:17.203959Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "When a packet is transmitted, it goes through the qdisc before reaching the driver:",
      "source_hash": 6392431738787556047,
      "context_hash": 9385548340630710783,
      "translation": "패킷이 전송될 때는 드라이버에 도달하기 전에 qdisc를 거칩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Qdiscs can be hierarchical:",
      "source_hash": 5389464405982986119,
      "context_hash": 1555553395175289033,
      "translation": "qdisc는 계층적으로 구성할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Viewing current qdisc",
      "source_hash": 7585708271993248233,
      "context_hash": 6397390799183027599,
      "translation": "현재 qdisc 확인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Common qdiscs",
      "source_hash": 9486815842807691348,
      "context_hash": 4639620753322641988,
      "translation": "주요 qdisc",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "pfifo_fast (default)",
      "source_hash": 3908433600802089327,
      "context_hash": 3075123437940651102,
      "translation": "pfifo_fast(기본값)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Three priority bands (0=high, 1=med, 2=low) based on the packet's DSCP/TOS field.",
      "source_hash": 6090572043865780489,
      "context_hash": 2614910308016148705,
      "translation": "패킷의 DSCP/TOS 필드를 기준으로 하는 세 개의 우선순위 밴드(0=높음, 1=중간, 2=낮음)로 구성됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Simple FIFO within each band.",
      "source_hash": 17948869061373474007,
      "context_hash": 12415630254498386835,
      "translation": "각 밴드 내에서는 단순 FIFO로 동작합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FIFO": "FIFO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "No rate limiting.",
      "source_hash": 8968189813931961143,
      "context_hash": 2907971874739146215,
      "translation": "속도 제한은 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "fq_codel (modern default on Linux desktops)",
      "source_hash": 12963090853210641408,
      "context_hash": 9149791769778733999,
      "translation": "fq_codel(최신 Linux 데스크톱의 기본값)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Fair Queueing + Controlled Delay (CoDel)**.",
      "source_hash": 229218384598647996,
      "context_hash": 9872830294994948619,
      "translation": "**Fair Queueing + Controlled Delay**(CoDel)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Combines fair per-flow scheduling with active queue management (AQM) to reduce bufferbloat:",
      "source_hash": 13218036357591898636,
      "context_hash": 7343382866283536555,
      "translation": "플로별 공정 스케줄링과 능동 큐 관리(AQM)를 결합하여 bufferbloat를 줄입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐",
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Parameters:",
      "source_hash": 16085718768976677472,
      "context_hash": 16787854698334198610,
      "translation": "매개변수:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "`target`: acceptable minimum standing queue delay (default 5ms)",
      "source_hash": 9661954551086464343,
      "context_hash": 6835095157169730194,
      "translation": "`target`: 허용 가능한 최소 상주 큐 지연(기본값 5ms)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`interval`: control loop interval for CoDel (default 100ms)",
      "source_hash": 14553921041406668749,
      "context_hash": 5490640884616153477,
      "translation": "`interval`: CoDel 제어 루프 간격(기본값 100ms)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "`flows`: number of hash buckets for fair queueing (default 1024)",
      "source_hash": 13972711138387287383,
      "context_hash": 1068560342195080393,
      "translation": "`flows`: 공정 큐잉을 위한 해시 버킷 수(기본값 1024)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "`ecn`: mark packets instead of dropping when possible",
      "source_hash": 9193905179242301770,
      "context_hash": 13321202998089119032,
      "translation": "`ecn`: 가능한 경우 패킷을 폐기하는 대신 마킹",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:35.750782Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "fq (Fair Queue — default for BBR)",
      "source_hash": 2513552912956053629,
      "context_hash": 4334235936094419329,
      "translation": "fq(Fair Queue(공정 큐) — BBR의 기본값)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:31:17.203959Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Per-flow fair queuing with pacing.",
      "source_hash": 6170332448971396988,
      "context_hash": 3588471251578031207,
      "translation": "페이싱(pacing)을 갖춘 플로별 공정 큐잉입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:13/seg:1",
      "source": "Allows each flow to specify its desired send rate.",
      "source_hash": 14681217605794491771,
      "context_hash": 6708960862873859042,
      "translation": "각 플로가 원하는 전송 속도를 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:13/seg:2",
      "source": "Required for TCP BBR congestion control's accurate pacing:",
      "source_hash": 9817702229402605071,
      "context_hash": 6039124966239887995,
      "translation": "TCP BBR 혼잡 제어의 정확한 페이싱에 필요합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "TBF (Token Bucket Filter)",
      "source_hash": 12212856792553530977,
      "context_hash": 12166597277587589593,
      "translation": "TBF (Token Bucket Filter)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "Rate-limits traffic to a specific bandwidth with burst allowance:",
      "source_hash": 10079592930918121721,
      "context_hash": 8828269491518505405,
      "translation": "버스트를 허용하면서 트래픽을 특정 대역폭으로 속도 제한합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "HTB (Hierarchical Token Bucket)",
      "source_hash": 7995965526450406979,
      "context_hash": 1282059090893570478,
      "translation": "HTB (Hierarchical Token Bucket)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "The standard choice for multi-class rate limiting.",
      "source_hash": 13631284354272871096,
      "context_hash": 10129766316754128926,
      "translation": "다중 클래스 속도 제한의 표준 선택지입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:19/seg:1",
      "source": "Supports a hierarchy of classes with guaranteed and ceiling rates:",
      "source_hash": 2847573470689102780,
      "context_hash": 3383821927082990210,
      "translation": "보장 속도와 상한 속도를 갖는 클래스 계층 구조를 지원합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "When class 1:10 uses less than 80Mbit, its unused bandwidth can be borrowed by 1:20 and 1:30, up to their ceiling (100Mbit).",
      "source_hash": 17159135640054190013,
      "context_hash": 15244071818925330610,
      "translation": "클래스 1:10이 80Mbit보다 적게 사용하면, 사용하지 않은 대역폭을 1:20과 1:30이 각자의 상한(100Mbit)까지 빌려 쓸 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "TC filters: classifying packets",
      "source_hash": 7766346087896636474,
      "context_hash": 14186085101806210094,
      "translation": "TC 필터: 패킷 분류",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Filters determine which class a packet goes to:",
      "source_hash": 365145753449413035,
      "context_hash": 16385037685513293650,
      "translation": "필터는 패킷이 어느 클래스로 갈지 결정합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "TC eBPF (TC-BPF)",
      "source_hash": 10250423051932700468,
      "context_hash": 14048158587172686746,
      "translation": "TC eBPF (TC-BPF)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF",
        "eBPF": "eBPF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "eBPF programs can be attached to TC as classifiers or actions.",
      "source_hash": 4939728152457753484,
      "context_hash": 12274209044768518797,
      "translation": "eBPF 프로그램은 분류기나 액션으로 TC에 연결할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "eBPF": "eBPF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Unlike XDP, TC-BPF runs **after `sk_buff` allocation**, enabling full packet modification:",
      "source_hash": 5979762259166312847,
      "context_hash": 13666457088694222726,
      "translation": "XDP와 달리 TC-BPF는 **`sk_buff` 할당 이후에** 실행되므로 패킷을 완전히 수정할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF",
        "XDP": "XDP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "TC-BPF verdicts:",
      "source_hash": 6837734284781903591,
      "context_hash": 11665431642633509002,
      "translation": "TC-BPF 판정 값:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`TC_ACT_OK` (= 0): pass to next stage",
      "source_hash": 11919774015434934808,
      "context_hash": 18170638024295508215,
      "translation": "`TC_ACT_OK` (= 0): 다음 단계로 전달",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:06.301855Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
